---
layout: base.njk
eleventyNavigation:
  key: Index
---
<section class="hero">
  <p class="overline">Cryptography · confidential computing · coordination systems · relational critical engineering</p>
  <h1 class="hero-name">zorvan</h1>
  <p class="lede">{{ site.tagline }}.</p>
  <p class="creed">
    I engineer systems where people can coordinate and answer for their actions
    <strong>without being surveilled, modelled, or steered</strong> — cryptography and confidential
    computing on one side; relational philosophy, critique, and an art of the in-between on the
    other. A cryptographer by trade, a relational thinker by disposition.
  </p>
  <p class="chips" aria-label="Interests">
    {%- for kw in interests.highlights %}<span class="tag">{{ kw }}</span>{% endfor %}
  </p>
  <p class="collab">
    Building <a href="/diewan/">Diewan</a> and <a href="/zwischen/">Zwischen</a> now, and looking
    for people who think in relations to build with. <a class="more" href="/colophon/">who I am</a>
  </p>
</section>

<section class="index-grid">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="idx">01</span>
    <h2>From the notebook</h2>
    <span class="aside">essays, synced from Medium</span>
  </div>
  {% if writing.length %}
  <ol class="entries">
    {%- for post in writing | limit(5) %}
    <li class="entry">
      <div class="meta">
        <span class="n">{{ loop.index | folio }}</span><br>
        <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3><a href="{{ post.url }}" rel="noopener">{{ post.title }}</a></h3>
        {% if post.subtitle %}<p class="sub">{{ post.subtitle }}</p>{% endif %}
        {% if post.excerpt %}<p class="ex">{{ post.excerpt }}</p>{% endif %}
      </div>
    </li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ol>
  <p style="margin-top:1.6rem"><a class="more" href="/writing/">the whole notebook</a></p>
  {% else %}
  <p class="muted">The feed is quiet at the moment. Read directly at <a href="https://medium.com/@zorvan">medium.com/@zorvan</a>.</p>
  {% endif %}
</section>

<section class="index-grid">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="idx">02</span>
    <h2>Selected work</h2>
    <span class="aside">blockchain · confidential computing · topology</span>
  </div>
  <div class="cards">
    {%- for item in projects.featured %}
    <a class="card" href="{{ item.url }}" rel="noopener">
      <div class="cname">{{ item.name }}</div>
      <p class="cdesc">{{ item.desc }}</p>
      <span class="clang">{{ item.lang }}</span>
    </a>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
  <p style="margin-top:1.6rem"><a class="more" href="/work/">all of the work</a></p>
</section>

<section class="index-grid">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="idx">03</span>
    <h2>Standing projects</h2>
    <span class="aside">infrastructure for collective life</span>
  </div>
  <p class="gnote" style="max-width:60ch">
    Two halves of one relational thesis — that people can coordinate and be held accountable
    <em>without</em> being modelled, predicted, or steered.
  </p>
  <div class="cards">
    <a class="card" href="/diewan/">
      <div class="cname">Diewan</div>
      <p class="cdesc">
        Infrastructure for an <strong>accountability economy</strong>: every consequential action
        travels with portable, verifiable proof of the mandate that permitted it. Authority stated,
        action proven, responsibility preserved.
      </p>
      <span class="clang">accountability · client-side validation</span>
    </a>
    <a class="card" href="/zwischen/">
      <div class="cname">Zwischen</div>
      <p class="cdesc">
        A <strong>coordination system for small groups</strong> that shapes how people relate to
        what is forming — through perception, not prediction; carrying memory from one gathering to
        the next, without modelling users or steering outcomes.
      </p>
      <span class="clang">coordination · the in-between</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
